  (text "Samtec pins: 1 protected 2S / 2 return / 3 AUX3V3 / 4 return / 5 SCL / 6 SDA / 7 FAULT / 8 NC.\nCroi owns connector-side pull-ups. Monitor-side pull-ups disappear with protected AUX.\nREADY is a local probe, never source-enable authority. FAULT reports; it cannot switch sources.\nEach return path must withstand the full alternate 6 A return independently."
    (at 20.32 236.22 0.0)
    (effects
