  (text "Sends protected 2S power to Burrito. Burrito returns 3.3 V to power Churro's measuring circuits.\nThe I2C buffer carries readings from f05/f06 back to Burrito; FAULT reports source-protection faults.\nLosing monitoring power must not remove autonomous battery protection."
    (at 15.24 22.86 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.4 1.4))
      (justify left top))
    (uuid "9027e7e0-7183-47a9-a064-fd4ba3135771")))
